# Local Claude config: a symlink to a path that only exists on one machine.
# Tracking it shipped a broken symlink to every clone, and Turbopack walks it
# while processing globals.css and dies with "leaves the filesystem root",
# which failed the droplet build and left the site serving a stale bundle.
.claude
